    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20179" root="سكب" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَكَابٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَكَابِ</span>, the latter [indecl., with kesr
for its termination,] like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَطَامِ</span>, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَكَّابٌ</span></b> , [all
app. meaning <i>The fleet,</i> or <i>swift,</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّكْبُ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأُسْكُوبُ</span>,] are names of certain horses. (K: the
second only mentioned in the S.)

